## 2. Critical Code-Level Findings

### FINDING-1: `@ts-nocheck` Suppression (42 Files)

**Severity: HIGH** — TypeScript compile-time safety is disabled across 42 server files, including security-critical and money-touching paths.

**Full inventory (42 files):**

| Category | Files | Risk |
|----------|------:|------|
| Auth/login/register/logout | 5 | 🔴 Credential handling without type checks |
| Profile routes (me, update, payout, kyc, sessions, etc.) | 11 | 🟡 User PII + financial data |
| Trade targets/journal/leaderboard/account/policy | 5 | 🟡 Trade lifecycle adjacent |
| Admin routes (scout, systemConfig, migration) | 3 | 🟡 Admin privilege paths |
| Core monoliths (traderCore, traderTalent, partnerPortal, authCore, wsCore) | 5 | 🔴 1,000+ LOC each, financial logic |
| Utilities (quoteFeed, storage, vite, migration) | 5 | 🟡 Infrastructure |
| Misc (captchaSlider, grift retention) | 2 | 🟢 Low risk |
| Other utils (forge*, previousClose, etc.) | 6 | 🟢 Data processing |

**Key concern:** [server/routes/auth/login.ts](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/routes/auth/login.ts), [register.ts](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/routes/auth/register.ts), [logout.ts](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/routes/auth/logout.ts) handle credentials without type safety. [traderCore.ts](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/routes/traderCore.ts) (1,719 LOC) and [partnerPortal.ts](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/routes/partnerPortal.ts) (1,664 LOC) process money with `@ts-nocheck`.

