### FINDING-3: `as any` Cast Density in Critical Paths

**Severity: MEDIUM** — 69 `as any` casts across 4 critical trade lifecycle files ([tradeOpen.ts](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/routes/trader/tradeOpen.ts), [tradeClose.ts](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/routes/trader/tradeClose.ts), [marginCall.ts](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/cron/marginCall.ts), [autoClose.ts](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/cron/autoClose.ts)).

Common patterns:
- [(trade as any).categorySnapshot](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/services/adminDataExportBuild.ts#348-353) — trade schema type doesn't include all columns
- [(trade as any).notionalUsd](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/services/adminDataExportBuild.ts#348-353) — same root cause
- [(symbolConfig as any).category](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/services/adminDataExportBuild.ts#348-353) — SymbolConfig type incomplete

**Root cause:** The Drizzle schema infers types from [schema.pg.ts](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/shared/schema.pg.ts) but many fields added later (cost model columns, excursion columns) aren't in the inferred [Trade](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/routes/traderCore.ts#59-64) type used by route handlers.

